stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Timestamp
  Timestamp --> Missing: no source timestamp
  Timestamp --> Invalid: unsupported type, syntax, date or clock
  Timestamp --> Valid: RFC3339 calendar instant
  Missing --> Unavailable: absolute / relative / waiting unavailable
  Invalid --> Unavailable: absolute / relative / waiting unavailable
  Valid --> Chicago: absolute Chicago label
  Valid --> Elapsed: relative age and complete waiting days
  Valid --> Future: future instant
  Future --> Clamped: just now / zero days waiting
